==================================================
一、基础信息
==================================================
1) 本地开发基地址
- http://127.0.0.1:5000

2) API前缀
- /api

3) 认证方式
- 绝大多数接口使用 Bearer Token
- 请求头：
  Authorization: Bearer <token>

4) Token获取
- 通过 POST /api/login 获取 token

5) 响应约定
- 成功通常返回 200/201 + JSON
- 失败返回 4xx/5xx + JSON:
  {
    "error": "错误信息"
  }

6) 续期响应头（仅 token_required 装饰器接口）
- X-Refreshed-Token
- X-Token-Expires

7) 未鉴权接口
- POST /api/login
- POST /api/forgot-password
- 采购模块全部接口：/api/procurements*

==================================================
二、认证模块 Auth
==================================================
[1] 登录
POST /api/login
请求体(JSON):
{
  "username": "admin",
  "password": "123456"
}
成功响应:
{
  "token": "...",
  "username": "admin",
  "full_name": "管理员",
  "expires": "..."
}

[2] 忘记密码
POST /api/forgot-password
请求体(JSON):
{
  "username": "admin",
  "answer": "密保答案",
  "new_password": "新密码"
}
成功响应:
{
  "message": "密码重置成功"
}

[3] 校验令牌
GET /api/verify-token
请求头: Authorization: Bearer <token>
成功响应:
{
  "message": "令牌有效"
}

[4] 修改密码
POST /api/change-password
请求头: Authorization: Bearer <token>
请求体(JSON):
{
  "old_password": "旧密码",
  "new_password": "新密码"
}
成功响应:
{
  "message": "密码修改成功"
}

==================================================
三、通知配置模块
==================================================
[1] 获取通知配置
GET /api/notification-config
鉴权: 需要

[2] 更新通知配置
PUT /api/notification-config
鉴权: 需要
请求体(JSON): 配置对象

[3] 测试邮件
POST /api/test-email
鉴权: 需要
请求体(JSON):
{
  "smtp_config": { ... },
  "recipient": "...",
  "sender": "...",
  "subject": "...",
  "content": "...",
  "use_ssl": true
}

[4] 测试短信
POST /api/test-sms
鉴权: 需要
请求体(JSON):
{
  "sms_config": { ... },
  "template_id": "...",
  "template_params": { ... }
}

==================================================
五、房间模块 Rooms
==================================================
[1] 房间列表
GET /api/rooms
鉴权: 需要
响应:
{
  "rooms": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "room_no": "A101",
      "building": "A栋",
      "floor": "1",
      "room_type": "单人间",
      "price": 1200,
      "description": "",
      "status": "空闲|在住|即将到期|已过期",
      "tenant_count": 0,
      "has_water_meter_img": false,
      "has_electricity_meter_img": false
    }
  ]
}

[2] 房间详情
GET /api/rooms/{room_id}
鉴权: 需要

[3] 按需获取水/电表二维码
GET /api/rooms/{room_id}/meter-image?type=water|electricity
鉴权: 需要
响应:
{
  "image": "data:image/... 或静态路径"
}

[4] 查询某房间租户
GET /api/rooms/{room_no}/tenants
鉴权: 需要

[5] 房间租户退房
POST /api/rooms/{room_no}/checkout
鉴权: 需要

[6] 新增房间
POST /api/rooms
鉴权: 需要
请求体(JSON)常用字段:
{
  "room_no": "A101",
  "floor": "1",
  "room_type": "单人间",
  "price": 1200,
  "building": "A栋",
  "description": "",
  "water_meter_img": "",
  "electricity_meter_img": ""
}

[7] 更新房间
PUT /api/rooms/{room_id}
鉴权: 需要
请求体(JSON): 可更新字段同新增

[8] 删除房间
DELETE /api/rooms/{room_id}
鉴权: 需要

==================================================
六、租户模块 Tenants
==================================================
[1] 租户列表
GET /api/tenants
鉴权: 需要

[2] 新增租户
POST /api/tenants
鉴权: 需要
请求体(JSON)必填:
- name
- gender
- id_card
- phone
- emergency_contact_name
- emergency_contact_phone
- check_in_date
- check_out_date
- room_no
可选:
- nationality
- id_address
- front_img
- back_img

[3] 编辑租户
PUT /api/tenants/{id_card}
鉴权: 需要

[4] 删除租户
DELETE /api/tenants/{id_card}
鉴权: 需要

[5] 退房
POST /api/tenants/{id_card}/checkout
鉴权: 需要

==================================================
七、搬迁模块 Moves
==================================================
[1] 搬迁记录列表
GET /api/moves
鉴权: 需要

[2] 租户搬迁
POST /api/moves/tenant
鉴权: 需要
请求体(JSON):
{
  "move_type": "single|all",
  "tenant_id": "...",      // single时常用
  "from_room": "A101",     // all时常用
  "to_room": "A201"
}

[3] 整房搬迁
POST /api/moves/room
鉴权: 需要
请求体(JSON):
{
  "from_room_no": "A101",
  "to_room_no": "A201"
}

[4] 删除搬迁记录
DELETE /api/moves/{move_id}
鉴权: 需要

==================================================
八、维修记录模块 Repair Records
==================================================
[1] 维修记录列表
GET /api/repair-records
鉴权: 需要

[2] 维修记录详情
GET /api/repair-records/{record_id}
鉴权: 需要

[3] 新增维修记录
POST /api/repair-records
鉴权: 需要
请求体(JSON)必填:
{
  "room_no": "A101",
  "repair_type": "水电",
  "description": "漏水",
  "report_by": "租户/管理员"
}

[4] 更新维修记录
PUT /api/repair-records/{record_id}
鉴权: 需要

[5] 删除维修记录
DELETE /api/repair-records/{record_id}
鉴权: 需要

[6] 按房间查询维修记录
GET /api/repair-records/room/{room_no}
鉴权: 需要

==================================================
九、系统模块 System
==================================================
[1] 导出系统数据
GET /api/system/export
鉴权: 需要
响应: application/zip 文件流
说明: 已加限流/互斥，频繁调用会返回429

[2] 导入系统数据
POST /api/system/import
鉴权: 需要
请求体: multipart/form-data
- file: zip文件

[3] 生成演示数据
POST /api/system/seed
鉴权: 需要

[4] 重置系统
POST /api/system/reset
鉴权: 需要

==================================================
十、合同模板模块 Contract Templates
==================================================
[1] 模板列表
GET /api/contract-templates
鉴权: 需要

[2] 模板详情
GET /api/contract-templates/{tid}
鉴权: 需要

[3] 新增模板
POST /api/contract-templates
鉴权: 需要
请求体(JSON):
{
  "name": "模板名",
  "description": "说明",
  "content_html": "<html>...</html>"
}

[4] 更新模板
PUT /api/contract-templates/{tid}
鉴权: 需要

[5] 删除模板
DELETE /api/contract-templates/{tid}
鉴权: 需要

[6] 模板渲染
POST /api/contract-templates/{tid}/render
鉴权: 需要
请求体(JSON):
{
  "vars": {
    "tenant_name": "张三",
    "room_no": "A101"
  }
}

==================================================
十一、合同档案模块 Contracts
==================================================
说明：本模块使用 before_request 鉴权，同样要求 Authorization: Bearer <token>

[1] 创建合同
POST /api/contracts
请求体(JSON):
{
  "template_id": 1,
  "vars": { ... }
}

[2] 合同列表
GET /api/contracts?page=1&page_size=10

[3] 合同详情
GET /api/contracts/{contract_id}

[4] 更新合同
PUT /api/contracts/{contract_id}
请求体(JSON):
{
  "vars": { ... }
}

==================================================
十二、采购模块 Procurement（当前无需鉴权）
==================================================
[1] 采购列表
GET /api/procurements?page=1&page_size=10&search=

[2] 新增采购
POST /api/procurements
请求体(JSON):
{
  "procurement_date": "2026-03-09",
  "item_name": "项目名",
  "specification": "规格",
  "quantity": 10,
  "unit": "个",
  "total_amount": 100.00,
  "remarks": ""
}

[3] 更新采购
PUT /api/procurements/{id}

[4] 删除采购
DELETE /api/procurements/{id}

==================================================
十三、库房模块 Warehouse
==================================================
[1] 物资列表
GET /api/warehouse-items?q=
鉴权: 需要

[2] 物资详情
GET /api/warehouse-items/{item_id}
鉴权: 需要

[3] 新增物资
POST /api/warehouse-items
鉴权: 需要
请求体(JSON):
{
  "item_name": "LED灯泡",
  "category": "照明",
  "quantity": 56,
  "unit": "个",
  "location": "A库-货架1层",
  "image": "data:image/png;base64,...",
  "remarks": "常用耗材"
}

[4] 更新物资
PUT /api/warehouse-items/{item_id}
鉴权: 需要

[5] 删除物资
DELETE /api/warehouse-items/{item_id}
鉴权: 需要

==================================================
十四、对接建议（APP）
==================================================
1) 先调用 /api/login，拿到 token 后统一加 Authorization 头
2) 对 token_required 接口，若响应头含 X-Refreshed-Token，建议更新本地token
3) 上传图片字段（如库房 image）使用 Base64 DataURL 最方便
4) 导出接口 /api/system/export 返回ZIP文件流，APP需走下载逻辑
5) 当前采购模块未鉴权，如需上线建议后端补齐鉴权

==================================================
接口总数：53
文档文件：Backend-System/API接口总览.txt
==================================================`)

function pickImportFile() {
  uni.chooseFile({
    count: 1,
    extension: ["zip"],
    success: (res : any) => {
      let path = ""
      if (res != null && res.tempFilePaths != null && res.tempFilePaths.length > 0) {
        path = String(res.tempFilePaths[0])
      } else if (res != null && res.tempFiles != null && res.tempFiles.length > 0) {
        path = String(res.tempFiles[0].path)
      }
      if (path != "") {
        importFilePath.value = path
        return
      }
      uni.showToast({ title: "未获取到文件路径", icon: "none" })
    },
    fail: () => {
      uni.showToast({ title: "选择文件失败，可手动输入路径", icon: "none" })
    },
  })
}

async function exportData() {
  if (exportLoading.value) {
    return
  }
  exportLoading.value = true
  try {
    const data = await apiExportSystemData()
    exportPath.value = data != null && data.tempFilePath != null ? String(data.tempFilePath) : ""
    if (exportPath.value != "") {
      uni.saveFile({
        tempFilePath: exportPath.value,
        success: (res : any) => {
          if (res != null && res.savedFilePath != null) {
            exportPath.value = String(res.savedFilePath)
          }
          uni.showToast({ title: "导出成功", icon: "success" })
        },
        fail: () => {
          uni.showToast({ title: "导出成功，已保存在临时路径", icon: "none" })
        },
      })
    }
  } catch (err) {
    uni.showToast({ title: getErrorMessage(err, "导出失败"), icon: "none" })
  } finally {
    exportLoading.value = false
  }
}

async function importData() {
  if (importLoading.value) {
    return
  }
  if (importFilePath.value.trim() == "") {
    uni.showToast({ title: "请选择或输入ZIP路径", icon: "none" })
    return
  }

  importLoading.value = true
  try {
    await apiImportSystemData(importFilePath.value.trim())
    uni.showToast({ title: "导入成功", icon: "success" })
  } catch (err) {
    uni.showToast({ title: getErrorMessage(err, "导入失败"), icon: "none" })
  } finally {
    importLoading.value = false
  }
}

function seedData() {
  if (seedLoading.value) {
    return
  }
  uni.showModal({
    title: "确认",
    content: "确认生成演示数据吗？",
    success: async (res) => {
      if (!res.confirm) {
        return
      }
      seedLoading.value = true
      try {
        await apiSeedSystemData()
        uni.showToast({ title: "生成成功", icon: "success" })
      } catch (err) {
        uni.showToast({ title: getErrorMessage(err, "生成失败"), icon: "none" })
      } finally {
        seedLoading.value = false
      }
    },
  })
}

function resetData() {
  if (resetLoading.value) {
    return
  }
  if (resetConfirmText.value.trim().toUpperCase() != "RESET") {
    uni.showToast({ title: "请输入 RESET 进行确认", icon: "none" })
    return
  }
  uni.showModal({
    title: "警告",
    content: "确认重置系统吗？此操作不可撤销，且会清空业务数据。",
    success: async (res) => {
      if (!res.confirm) {
        return
      }
      resetLoading.value = true
      try {
        await apiResetSystemData()
        uni.showToast({ title: "重置成功", icon: "success" })
      } catch (err) {
        uni.showToast({ title: getErrorMessage(err, "重置失败"), icon: "none" })
      } finally {
        resetLoading.value = false
      }
    },
  })
}

function copyOverview() {
  uni.setClipboardData({
    data: apiOverviewText.value,
    success: () => {
      uni.showToast({ title: "已复制到剪贴板", icon: "success" })
    },
    fail: () => {
      uni.showToast({ title: "复制失败", icon: "none" })
    },
  })
}

function goBack() {
  const pages = getCurrentPages()
  if (pages != null && pages.length > 1) {
    uni.navigateBack({ delta: 1 })
    return
  }
  uni.reLaunch({ url: "/pages/home/index" })
}

</script>

